{"id":"en_spokesman-of-heaven","title":"Spokesman of Heaven","titleEn":"Spokesman of Heaven","description":"After a rescue leaves Evan Chase in a coma for 100 days, he wakes to find he possesses divine healing abilities. At Oakwood Hospital he brings an elder back to life, then goes on to help several influential families. While staying with Mia Voss, he launches a herbal clinic and earns renown for his remarkable cures. The two share a string of adventures that gradually dissolve their initial tension, giving rise to a gentle romance. Dramzio is a place where viewers can follow this series.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/spokesman-of-heaven/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/spokesman-of-heaven/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Urban","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ct6c2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_spokesman-of-heaven_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ct6c2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_spokesman-of-heaven_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ct6c2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_spokesman-of-heaven_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ct6c2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_spokesman-of-heaven_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ct6c2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_spokesman-of-heaven_5","title":"Episode 5","se